│ ADR 001-use-sqlite-default · 2026-10-03   │ docs/adr     │\r\n│         │ store unde...                            │                                           │              │\r\n│ + ADDED │ We prefer stateless JWT tokens and avoid │ ADR 005-prefer-stateless-tokens ·         │ docs/adr     │\r\n│         │ server...                                │ 2026-09-28                                │              │\r\n│ + ADDED │ We use stateful server-side sessions     │ ADR 004-use-stateful-sessions ·           │ docs/adr     │\r\n│         │ with a Red...                            │ 2026-09-28                                │              │\r\n│ + ADDED │ `codegraph serve` opens the browser only │ CHANGELOG · Changed · 2026-10-03          │ CHANGELOG.md │\r\n│         │ after ...                                │                                           │              │\r\n└─────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────┘\r\n\r\nSummary: 11 added · 0 changed · 0 removed · 0 superseded\r\n"]
